<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cindrome - Review by @Shehab</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/logos/cindrome-logo.png">

    <!-- Font Awesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/navbar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages/single-review.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/modals.css">
</head>

<body class="single-review-page logged-in">
    <!-- Navbar -->
    <header>
        <%- include("partials/navbar.ejs") %>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="single-review-main">

        <!-- Backdrop Section -->
        <section class="review-backdrop-wrapper"
            style="background-image: url('https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w1000_and_h563_face/bI37vIHSH7o4IVkq37P8cfxQGMx.jpg');">
            <div class="backdrop-gradient-overlay"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- Review Content Container -->
        <section class="review-content-container">

            <!-- 1. EXTERNAL MOVIE INFO -->
            <div class="external-movie-header">
                <a href="/details" class="external-poster-link">
                    <img src="/assets/posters/poster-theboys.webp" alt="The Boys Poster" class="external-main-poster">
                </a>

                <div class="external-movie-info">
                    <h1 class="external-movie-title"><a href="/details">The Boys</a> <span
                            class="external-movie-year">(2019)</span></h1>
                    <div class="episode-meta-pill">
                        Season 1 • Episode 8 • "You Found Me"
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. THE REVIEW CARD -->
            <article class="review-card-unified">

                <!-- Card Header -->
                <div class="card-user-header">

                    <div class="reviewer-meta-inside">
                        <a href="/profile"><img src="/assets/avatars/shehab.jpg" alt="Shehab" class="card-avatar"
                                onerror="this.src='/assets/profile-avatar.jpg'"></a>
                        <div class="card-user-details">
                            <span class="card-username"><a href="/profile">@Shehab_Aboshady</a></span>
                            <div class="card-rating-date">
                                <span class="stars" title="4.5 Stars">★★★★<span class="half-star">★</span></span>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart favorite-heart" title="Favorited"></i>
                                <span class="dot-divider">•</span>
                                <span class="review-date">August 20, 2026</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card-spoiler-badge" id="spoilerBadge">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i> Spoiler
                    </div>
                </div>

                <hr class="card-divider">

                <!-- Review Text -->
                <div id="reviewTextWrapper" class="review-text-wrapper is-spoiler" title="Click to reveal spoiler">
                    <div class="review-text blurred-text">
                        <p>
                            Absolute cinematic masterpiece. The pacing is phenomenal, and Antony Starr deserves all the
                            awards for his performance as Homelander. I can't wait for the next season!
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            What makes this show stand out isn't just the gore or the shock value, but the incredibly
                            sharp writing that satirizes our current celebrity worship and corporate greed. The Boys
                            takes the concept of "what if superheroes were real" and applies the most cynical, yet
                            realistic, lens possible.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Every character has layers. Butcher is despicable yet you root for him. Hughie is the moral
                            compass constantly being corrupted. It’s a masterclass in character development.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <hr class="actions-divider">

                <!-- 🌟 Actions (Like & Share) 🌟 -->
                <div class="review-actions-bar">
                    <!-- Like SVG Button -->
                    <button class="action-btn like-btn" id="reviewLikeBtn" aria-label="Like Review">
                        <svg class="interactive-svg like-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path
                                d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z">
                            </path>
                        </svg>
                        <span class="action-count">1.2k</span>
                    </button>
                    <!-- Share SVG Button -->
                    <button class="action-btn share-btn" id="reviewShareBtn" aria-label="Share Review"
                        title="Copy link">
                        <svg class="interactive-svg share-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle>
                            <circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
                            <circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle>
                            <line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49"></line>
                            <line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49"></line>
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- 3. MODERN COMMENTS SECTION -->
            <section id="comments-section" class="list-comments-wrapper">
                <div class="comments-header-row">
                    <h2 class="comments-title">Comments <span class="comments-count">42</span></h2>
                </div>

                <!-- إضافة تعليق رئيسي (Modern Inline Box) -->
                <div class="add-comment-box">
                    <img src="/assets/avatars/shehab.jpg" alt="My Avatar" class="comment-avatar"
                        onerror="this.src='/assets/profile-avatar.jpg'">
                    <div class="modern-input-wrapper">
                        <textarea class="comment-textarea" placeholder="Add a comment." rows="1"></textarea>
                        <button class="modern-post-btn" title="Post Comment">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line>
                                <polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon>
                            </svg>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <hr class="comments-divider">

                <!-- قائمة التعليقات -->
                <div class="comments-list">

                    <!-- تعليق 1 مع رد نشط -->
                    <div class="comment-thread">
                        <div class="single-comment">
                            <img src="/assets/avatars/shehab.jpg" alt="User" class="comment-avatar"
                                onerror="this.src='/assets/profile-avatar.jpg'">
                            <div class="comment-content-wrapper">
                                <div class="comment-header">
                                    <span class="comment-user">@Ahmed_Ali</span>
                                    <span class="comment-time">2h</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="comment-text">Great review! The tension in this specific episode was insane.
                                </p>
                                <div class="comment-interactions">
                                    <button class="interaction-btn">
                                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <path
                                                d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z">
                                            </path>
                                        </svg> 12
                                    </button>
                                    <button class="interaction-btn reply-trigger">
                                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <path
                                                d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z">
                                            </path>
                                        </svg> Reply
                                    </button>
                                </div>

                                <!-- صندوق الرد المتداخل -->
                                <div class="inline-reply-box">
                                    <img src="/assets/avatars/shehab.jpg" alt="My Avatar"
                                        class="comment-avatar small-avatar"
                                        onerror="this.src='/assets/profile-avatar.jpg'">
                                    <div class="modern-input-wrapper">
                                        <textarea class="comment-textarea" placeholder="Reply to @Ahmed_Ali."
                                            rows="1"></textarea>
                                        <button class="modern-post-btn" title="Send Reply">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                                <line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line>
                                                <polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon>
                                            </svg>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                    <button class="reply-cancel-btn" title="Cancel Reply">Cancel</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Nested Reply -->
                        <div class="nested-replies">
                            <div class="single-comment reply-comment">
                                <img src="/assets/avatars/shehab.jpg" alt="Author" class="comment-avatar small-avatar"
                                    onerror="this.src='/assets/profile-avatar.jpg'">
                                <div class="comment-content-wrapper">
                                    <div class="comment-header">
                                        <span class="comment-user">@Shehab</span>
                                        <span class="comment-badge">AUTHOR</span>
                                        <span class="comment-time">1h</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="comment-text">Totally agree. The writing subverts all the typical
                                        superhero tropes we are used to.</p>
                                    <div class="comment-interactions">
                                        <button class="interaction-btn">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                                <path
                                                    d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z">
                                                </path>
                                            </svg> 5
                                        </button>
                                        <button class="interaction-btn reply-trigger">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                                <path
                                                    d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z">
                                                </path>
                                            </svg> Reply
                                        </button>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="inline-reply-box">
                                        <img src="/assets/avatars/shehab.jpg" alt="My Avatar"
                                            class="comment-avatar small-avatar"
                                            onerror="this.src='/assets/profile-avatar.jpg'">
                                        <div class="modern-input-wrapper">
                                            <textarea class="comment-textarea" placeholder="Reply to @Shehab."
                                                rows="1"></textarea>
                                            <button class="modern-post-btn" title="Send Reply">
                                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                                    stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                                    <line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line>
                                                    <polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon>
                                                </svg>
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                        <button class="reply-cancel-btn" title="Cancel Reply">Cancel</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- تعليق 2 -->
                    <div class="comment-thread">
                        <div class="single-comment">
                            <img src="/assets/avatars/shehab.jpg" alt="User" class="comment-avatar"
                                onerror="this.src='/assets/profile-avatar.jpg'">
                            <div class="comment-content-wrapper">
                                <div class="comment-header">
                                    <span class="comment-user">@Nour99</span>
                                    <span class="comment-time">5h</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="comment-text">Antony Starr's acting is out of this world. W review.</p>
                                <div class="comment-interactions">
                                    <button class="interaction-btn">
                                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <path
                                                d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z">
                                            </path>
                                        </svg> 3
                                    </button>
                                    <button class="interaction-btn reply-trigger">
                                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <path
                                                d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z">
                                            </path>
                                        </svg> Reply
                                    </button>
                                </div>

                                <div class="inline-reply-box">
                                    <img src="/assets/avatars/shehab.jpg" alt="My Avatar"
                                        class="comment-avatar small-avatar"
                                        onerror="this.src='/assets/profile-avatar.jpg'">
                                    <div class="modern-input-wrapper">
                                        <textarea class="comment-textarea" placeholder="Reply to @Nour99."
                                            rows="1"></textarea>
                                        <button class="modern-post-btn" title="Send Reply">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                                <line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line>
                                                <polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon>
                                            </svg>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                    <button class="reply-cancel-btn" title="Cancel Reply">Cancel</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </section>

        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>
        <%- include("partials/modals/search-modal.ejs") %>
            <%- include("partials/modals/log-modal.ejs") %>
                <!-- Scripts -->
                <script src="/js/modals.js"></script>
                <script src="/js/pages/single-review.js"></script>
</body>

</html>